  "leakage_warning": "The faithful protocol reproduces the historical code exactly, including a single global tuner whose best model and score persist across all folds. In the audited run the global best was fold-1 trial-6 and never improved across the remaining 494 trials, so every fold's reported metric is that one model evaluated on each fold's validation split. This is a repeatable source-faithful historical statistic and MUST NOT be relabelled as a clean nested-CV estimate.",
  "mutation_side_feature_note": "Hybrid features are built by the maintained cancer_rec_system/training/features.py module from targeted_therapy.csv. The builder reproduces all eight audited prepared-data, mapping, label, and feature fingerprints exactly. Interventions are canonicalized before the item mapping, giving 12049 items (versus the ID-only NCF's order-sensitive 13120) at feature dimension 31.",
